<title>UK: UK IMRO has no comment on Horlick suspension.</title>
<headline>UK IMRO has no comment on Horlick suspension.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's investments watchdog IMRO declined to comment on Tuesday after Deutsche Morgan Grenfell (DMG), the investment banking arm of Germany's Deutsche Bank suspended Nicola Horlick, head of Morgan Grenfell Asset Management.</p>
<p>&quot;It's not approproiate for IMRO to comment on matters relating to its firms and what they may be doing with regards to their staff,&quot; a spokeswoman for IMRO said.</p>
<p>DMG said Horlick's suspension was &quot;purely internal&quot; and had no regulatory dimension nor link to the sacking of fund manager Peter Young last year for gross misconduct.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
